s judgement and is not checked against the package.","status":"unverifiable"}},{"detail":"80465c8b = upstream 913e112d applied on quattro-proof 1e433732 (MenuModel.js scanner + warn, docs/menu.md, the PR's menu-test.sh hunk at lines 67-73). I compared its product diff with the upstream PR diff: the 51 changed lines are identical (and identical to the previous mirror's apply commit), and no later commit touches shell/, docs/, default/, config/ or bin/. 339dc4b1..a13a657b = our proof work, replayed onto the new baseline: witnesses and tripwires (339dc4b1), KI filing (bfe677eb: INLINE-COMMENT fixed, COMMENT-INDENT-WHITESPACE new_defect), trace re-review of the requirement records (55e94001, eb2e548b), KI evidence and prose, the reproducer bound in the menu-node suite (623af0d2), introduced_in edits replayed from earlier builds, and a13a657b (INLINE-COMMENT notes and history re-ordered after the replay). c5e2957c is the empty record commit at the tip. Between the previous baseline 0c01de03 and 1e433732 no menu code, menu test or behaviour-diff file changed except one BarWidget.qml property (centerFigures: false) and a new lock test file; the upstream refresh touches the lock component, outside this PR.","refs":[{"id":"shell/plugins/menu/MenuModel.js","kind":"file","line":1},{"id":"docs/menu.md","kind":"file","line":1},{"id":"test/shell.d/menu-test.sh","kind":"file","line":67}],"severity":"info","title":"Mirror composition: the upstream change vs our proof-layer work","verification":{"evidence":[],"method":"untyped finding","note":"No typed claim: this finding is the author's judgement and is not checked against the package.","status":"unverifiable"}},{"detail":"KI-MENU-JSONC-COMMENT-INDENT-WHITESPACE says introduced_in: a3a661bcf (KI line 20) and its evidence manifest was captured at revision e57c295d. Both are commits of the previous build on quattro-proof 0c01de03; neither is an ancestor of the evaluated commit c5e2957c (git merge-base --is-ancestor). On this tree the