here and fails on the base. It should be fixed, not accepted (as #13968 b2dae8db does). The harness missed it (its data partition puts the character before every line) and test_diff did not flag the flipped menu-test.sh witness. Readiness is not_assessed; next decision human_judgement (compat_changes_unapproved): 6 compatibility changes await a reviewer (cf-dc379a6e is fixed); auditor notes (not approvals) record five as acceptable and cf-39627352 as not intended. The KI's introduced_in (a3a661bc) names a commit of the previous build, not this tree's 80465c8b. QV4 parity of the new branch is unobserved.\n\n**Traceability.** 26 requirements code_changed (E4J2 and 3T3F at function level); no unmapped file, no spec-gap candidate. E4J2's text still says 'full-line' comments.\n**Not caused by this PR.** Effects not analyzed (effects_unavailable); 13 checks skipped by configuration; COMMA-IN-STRING, ARRAY-ROOT, UNICODE-WHITESPACE, CR-LINE-ENDINGS, STRIP-GAPS pre-date it."}
